Z||000000||CanadianGT||05-22-2001||08:52 PM||||I was wondering if it is worth it to take the cat off my GT and straight pipe it.  Has anyone done this and noticed a noticable difference. I am thining of doing this soon after I pass emissions..  Opinions on this would be welcome.<BR>Thanks<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
